OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy day for many with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of light rain and drizzle at
OL,7,Ftimes, especially over western hills.
OL,8,FHowever, it will be drier with some
OL,9,Fbrighter spells developing in some
OL,10,Fsheltered eastern areas. Windy at
OL,11,Ffirst, gradually easing. Mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA narrow band of rain quickly
OL,14,Fclearing south this evening. A brief
OL,15,Fdrier interlude follows, before cloud
OL,16,Fthickens to bring further outbreaks of
OL,17,Frain overnight. Relatively mild. Light
OL,18,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
