OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA rather cloudy and damp
OL,6,Fstart, with outbreaks of light rain
OL,7,Fand drizzle, especially on western
OL,8,Fhills. Becoming drier and brighter
OL,9,Finto the afternoon. Light winds.
OL,10,FTemperatures near average.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FLargely dry with sunny spells
OL,14,FWednesday, after a chilly start.
OL,15,FMostly dry with sunny spells Thursday.
OL,16,FChance of a few coastal showers.
OL,17,FBreezier, with rain spreading east
OL,18,FFriday. Cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
